calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids has 75 years on record, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle ran 38% of normal in January to February and 181% in June to July. So far in 2026, April to May sits at 81% and May to June at 86%. Every grid here had its driest year in 1976.</p>"}
